d precision grip\n  * Cold intolerance in 30-50% of patients\n  * Potential for painful neuroma formation (5-10%)\n\n**For this 28-year-old construction worker:**\n- Given his young age and acute presentation, prognosis is relatively favorable\n- However, he should be counseled that return to heavy manual labor may be challenging\n- Occupational retraining may be necessary depending on recovery\n- Full recovery is unlikely, with most patients having some permanent deficit\n- Protective sensation should return, but fine discriminative sensation may remain impaired",
