    "examination_overview": "**Inspection**\n- Shoulder contour and symmetry\n- Visible deformity at AC joint (\"step\" deformity)\n- Skin integrity\n- Patient posture and arm position\n\n**Palpation**\n- Point tenderness over AC joint\n- Clavicle stability assessment\n- Sternoclavicular joint examination\n\n**Range of Movement**\n- Active and passive ROM in all planes\n- Pain-limited movements\n- Scapulothoracic rhythm\n\n**Special Tests**\n- Cross-arm adduction test\n- AC joint compression test\n- O'Brien's test\n- Horizontal adduction test\n\n**Neurovascular Assessment**\n- Distal pulses\n- Sensation in all dermatomes\n- Motor function of rotator cuff muscles\n- Brachial plexus assessment\n\n**Specific AC Joint Tests**\n- Piano key sign\n- Scarf test\n- Weight-bearing comparison test",
