estore anterior humeral line\n\n4. **Follow-up assessment:**\n   - Used to monitor maintenance of reduction\n   - Early detection of loss of reduction\n\nThese radiographic parameters are essential for both initial assessment and evaluation of reduction quality, with direct impact on functional and cosmetic outcomes.",
