Classification of fracture\n   - Reduction quality assessment (anterior humeral line, Baumann's angle)\n   - Operative details including pin configuration\n\nThese guidelines emphasize the emergency nature of supracondylar fractures with vascular compromise, appropriate surgical technique, and careful monitoring for complications. They provide a framework for standardized care to optimize outcomes and minimize complications.",
