h crutches\n\n3. **Patient education**\n   - Expected course and timeline\n   - Warning signs requiring urgent review\n   - Rehabilitation expectations\n\nThe key principles are: urgent reduction, thorough vascular assessment, appropriate immobilization, and careful monitoring while planning definitive management. If vascular repair is required, this takes precedence over ligament reconstruction, which may need to be delayed.",
